gs\n   ### \ud83d\udfe2 Good\n   ### \ud83d\udca1 Improvement suggestions for today\n   ```\n\n   Write the full report to `~/.hermes/reports/strategist-audit-$(date +%Y-%m-%d).md` and then deliver the summary here.",
